    "article_summary": "The article describes a photocatalytic three-component synthesis of functionalized \u03b3-lactams using secondary amines, alkenes, and CO2. A key innovation is the direct use of impure CO2 streams, such as car exhaust gas, as a sustainable carbon source. The reaction is mediated by an iridium photocatalyst under visible light, demonstrating broad substrate scope and applicability to late-stage functionalization of bioactive molecules.",
